{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>וְשִׁמְעוּ</b> — letters of שֵׁמַע with a vav. He said to them שְׁמַע יִשְׂרָאֵל, which has six words:" "<b>וְשִׁמְעוּ בְּנֵי יַעֲקֹב</b> — וְשִׁמְעוּ in gematria: he sought to reveal the End." "<b>וְשִׁמְעוּ אֵל יִשְׂרָאֵל</b> in gematria — this is the end of King Messiah."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 49, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:18:39.361571982Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}